{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111933","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111933/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111933/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111933/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111933","id":3542005971,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7THrjT","number":111933,"title":"Mipmaps `limit` is ignored when importing Texture2D","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-10-22T18:52:35Z","updated_at":"2025-10-22T19:16:47Z","closed_at":"2025-10-22T19:16:31Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.5.1\nNOT reproducible in 4.4\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen importing to a **Texture2D**, `mipmaps/limit` is absolutely ignored. No matter the value, the importing always behaves as it were set to -1 (that is, no limit). This was not the case in Godot `4.4`.\n\n<img width=\"572\" height=\"281\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e7689d8b-5d41-4b1a-81f1-70372a9074b7\" />\n\nNote that `mipmaps/generate` is still considered. If disabled, no mipmaps will generate appropriately.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n\n- Assuming a new project, select `icon.png` in the **FileSystem** dock.\n    - It can really be any image to be imported as a Texture2D\n- In the **Import** dock, enable `mipmaps/generate`\n- In the **Import** dock, set `mipmaps/limit` to a small, arbitrary value greater than `1`\n- In the **Inspector** dock, look at the resulting image's data in the preview. You may notice the limit is not respected.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThis does not require any _specific_ project to test.","closed_by":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.c